  "comments": "<p>For the 2008 issue some strikes seem to be missing part of one leaf, it is likely due to worn dies. Also, in 2008 a <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://en.numista.com/101474\">mule </a>was accidently introduced using the obverse from this coin with the Matthew Dent Royal Shield reverse.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/695bb2984af40.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/695bb2984af40.jpg\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Reports have been received regarding 2000, 2001 and 2002 dated issues having a slightly different shaped 2 than the rest of this series. In the examples below, the top of the 2 in 2000 ends in a curved drop while the top of the 2 in 2005 ends in a straight line.<br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5c6936c1d3a81.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5c6936c1d3a81.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5c6936ccb0912.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5c6936ccb0912.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>&nbsp;</p>",
